From 18ad31a173d80fafbc5f198f8f2765139ac0b222 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:16:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: meson: Carry SC2 non-PCM audio through the SPDIF
 sampler

Connect the SC2 internal SPDIF route to a second HDMI DAI, retaining
ordinary I2S PCM and the optical backend. Keep channel-map ownership
and stream directions per DAI. Consume IEC958 controls during prepare
after ALSA hooks, preserve raw-data validity through unmute, and reset
all packet state when returning to PCM. Keep HBR unsupported until its
emitted status contract is established on SC2.

The matching LibreELEC kernel package builds with this series.

Change-Id: I6561733bbd1a7bd6818b9ce39768c4f9730e5e59
